// The parameter of chr() must be an integer, and an integer is an Int or an
// integer-valued Number (spec/05-stdlib.md, Integer arguments). The Int form
// prints the same byte as the Number form; a fractional Number is still a
// runtime error that halts the program.
// COVERS: integer-arg chr
// STATUS: error
// CHECK: A
// CHECK: A
print chr(65);
print chr(65i);
chr(65.5);
print "unreachable";
